  "-1263460421": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Welcome to my facility for research that the hospital board considers… inconvenient.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "528224766": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1273735527,
    178849838,
    509592464
   ],
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "They call it unethical... I call it unrestricted. Every discovery worth a damn was made by someone the world called insane first.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-9885634": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1061625545,
   "children": [
    -709416151
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You make it sound like that was a test.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-984169928": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1061625545,
   "children": [
    730804618
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You really built a lab under a damn warehouse?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "730804618": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -984169928,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I prefer isolation. The harbor keeps curious eyes away. Saltwater helps with waste disposal.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-709416151": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -9885634,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Everything’s a test. I just don’t always announce the parameters.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1972376667": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1061625545,
   "children": [
    1793244000
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Gotta admit, doc, you sure know how to set a mood.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1793244000": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1972376667,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Don’t flatter yourself. The lighting’s for visibility, not foreplay.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1273735527": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    536083308
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You’re working on something big, aren’t you?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "536083308": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1273735527,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "‘Big’ isn’t the word. Revolutionary fits better.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "178849838": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    833537285
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Sounds like mad scientist talk to me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "833537285": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 178849838,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "If being sane means crawling at society’s pace, I’ll take madness every time.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "509592464": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    2097611685
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Unrestricted, huh? That word sounds kinda sexy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2097611685": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 509592464,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Science is erotic, in a way. It’s about penetration... of limits, of truth. Not everyone survives the climax.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "134361379": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Now. You probably wonder why you are here? It's simple. I need your help.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-743245690": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Data. Samples. Probes from species most people dismiss as fiction. Vampires, lycanthropes, hybrids.....",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "759633639": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -868335283,
    606261526
   ],
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Biological goldmines hidden behind myths. I’ve tracked them, studied traces, but there’s a barrier I can’t cross. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-868335283": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 759633639,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "And that would be…?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "606261526": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 759633639,
   "actor": null,
   "text": "What do you need?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1962772180": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You. Specifically, what you’re carrying. Let’s not pretend you’re modest. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1878236622": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1098924292,
    753661643,
    1952301977
   ],
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Your physiology is… advantageous. A very persuasive instrument for extraction.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1098924292": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1878236622,
   "children": [
    -246076224
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You want me to… seduce monsters for science?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-246076224": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1098924292,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Seduction, cooperation... semantics. I need living tissue, secretions, pheromone readings. You can get closer than I ever could.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "753661643": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1878236622,
   "children": [
    -806972655
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "That’s your big plan? Send me to screw vampires?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-806972655": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 753661643,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Call it what you like. Ethics won’t grow new organs. I’m offering discovery. You’re offering access.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1952301977": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1878236622,
   "children": [
    -508710747
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Didn’t think you’d be the one begging for a sample, doc.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-508710747": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1952301977,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Don’t flatter yourself. I’m not begging. I’m delegating. Efficiently.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1343891673": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "In return I will share My research. Once I have enough data, I can refine enhancement serums... hormonal, muscular, regenerative.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-226651364": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1157667448,
    640358829,
    -872208652
   ],
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "Imagine being able to adjust form at will. Breasts, endurance, arousal control.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1157667448": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -226651364,
   "children": [
    -1684921690
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You’re saying I help you, and you’ll share the tech?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1684921690": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1157667448,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Precisely. Mutual benefit. Scientific cooperation through unconventional methodology.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "640358829": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -226651364,
   "children": [
    485142095
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Breast-growth pills? Finally, real science.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "485142095": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 640358829,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Don’t mock it. The cosmetic industry would kill for what I’m developing. Literally.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-872208652": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -226651364,
   "children": [
    820780445
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You want supernatural cumshots and I get miracle boobs. Fair trade.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "820780445": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -872208652,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "That’s one way to summarize the transaction. I prefer “symbiotic data exchange.”",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1302362668": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -752822070,
    -1237253678
   ],
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "So. Will you assist, or should I start recruiting from the Neon Row district instead?",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-752822070": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1302362668,
   "children": [
    -1042855602
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Alright, I’m in.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1042855602": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -752822070,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Good. Try not to die... or worse, fall in love with the subject. Both outcomes complicate the paperwork.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1237253678": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1302362668,
   "children": [
    -1725913377,
    1063260398
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "No deal. This is insane.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1725913377": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1237253678,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Curiosity’s the only thing separating humans from animals. I suggest you don’t lose it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1063260398": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1237253678,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You will change your mind and I... I will be here, waiting.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  }
 },
